    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry founded by Gayaneh Bagdasaryan and Vyacheslav Kirilenko. Specializes in Latin and Cyrillic typefaces (21+ families incl. Aeroport, Wermut, Activist, Formular, Geometria, Brutal Type). Established, well-regarded foundry with a long catalogue; running it since the early 2010s suggests senior, fully autonomous principals. Type design house, Autonomy 5 as an independent foundry. Country conflict: legal imprint (clipped body) shows Berlin, Germany (Utrechter Str. 28, 13347 Berlin); Behance and MyFonts list Moscow, Russia. Two independent primary sources conflict; Open Question raised for Jonathan to resolve. LinkedIn: no profile found for either Bagdasaryan or Kirilenko as type designers; multiple name-matches are unrelated professionals. Instagram found: @brownfoxtype (https://www.instagram.com/brownfoxtype/, verified via Behance profile). Sanity/Next.js site prefetches images globally; scraper --render caused DOM contamination on typeface pages, so Formular/Geometria/Wermut/Activist specimens sourced from Behance galleries instead. Aeroport in-use specimens sourced from Fonts In Use (Gorky Park festival, 2018; Avangard catalogue, 2019).",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-06-25T20:51:58",
      "set_by": "agent"
